    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 25/06/2025 the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 25/06/2025 and numbered Unnumbered Site Location Plan, SD2436(P)01-B, SD2436(P)02-C was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\n\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E, Clause E(a) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the proposed outbuilding would not be required for a purpose incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse as it includes a bathroom."
